neering improvements)\n- Target: >38 final_score\n', 'file_path': '/inspire/qb-ilm/project/cq-scientific-cooperation-zone/public/ywang/meta-harness-evolver/project/project-2-simple-split-model/hoss-evolution-claude/candidates/candidate_1/proposer_reasoning.md'}
